<Input><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">Adding the golden section method to the algorithm ensures fewer iterations are made, by narrowing the interval containing the minimizer. The interval is reduced so that the ratio from the smaller to the larger subinterval is equal to the golden ratio (1.618)</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
