<Input><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">The newton-raphson includes the use of the Hessian matrix to speed up convergence, instead of relying solely on the slope/first derivative. It basically finds the quadratic approximation of f would be minimized. Mathematically it is given by:
<Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation></Text-field>
</Input>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
