<Input><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">where <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation> is the Hessian matrix at xk, which can be expensive to compute for large sets/n. This can be mitigated by dividing each set into smaller batches, and computing batchwise.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
