<Group view="presentation" inline-output="false" labelreference="L208" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true" applyexponent="false">
<Input><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">from the exercise, it is clear that in this particular instance, the steepest descent algorithm is faster than the newton raphson, as the steepest descent is deon in 173 iterations, and newton raphson takes 340. </Text-field>
</Input>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
